      "archaeologicalRemains": "unknown",
      "details": "<p>BAtlas 20 cites Bo\u017ei\u010d 1987, 857 for the possible location of Ivan\u010dica, Croatia. The notes in the Loeb edition of Velleius Paterculus (2.112.3) and the more recent Yardley and Barrett (2011) translation of the same text claim that the mountain range was near the modern city of Warasdin, just north of the proposed location, on the right bank of the Drava River.</p>",
